# Optimal power flow

This branch solves the exact AC problem: least-cost generation with the full network equations, voltage and reactive limits, line ratings and bus prices.

## Choosing A Surface

Use `opf` where losses, reactive power or voltages are part of the question; use `dispatch` for lossless studies of many scenarios.

## Practical Examples

The examples exercise the principal surface of this branch.

### Example 1

A ring checked against an independent solver.

@@example Eng/api/power_opf_ring.cpp@@

### Example 2

Reactive, voltage and rating limits.

@@example Eng/api/power_opf_limits.cpp@@

### Example 3

Tolerances and budget.

